<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Ill Superconductor rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Ill Superconductor rated buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Chicago Corp said Monday it initiated coverage of Illinois Superconductor Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>--Its earnings per share estimates are for a loss of $2.33 in 1996, a loss of $1.65 in 1997 and earnings of $0.20 in 1998.</p>
<p>--&quot;Our 12-month price target is $25 based on order backlog in 1997 and estimated financial results in 1998-99,&quot; Chicago Corp noted in a report.</p>
<p>--Illinois Superconductor was trading at 17-1/2, up 1/4.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
